# Project Architecture

- Stack: Next.js App Router (`app/`), React 19, Tailwind v4, TypeScript UI + mostly JS server services
- AI: direct `@anthropic-ai/sdk` streaming (not Vercel AI SDK); SSE via `lib/server/utils/sse.ts`
- Data: Supabase (`@supabase/supabase-js`) for RAG/memory — no Prisma/ORM
- Pages: `/` web search, `/real-estate`, `/weather`, `/multi-agent`
- Client API map: `lib/api.ts`; streaming: `hooks/useChatStream.ts`
- Deploy: single Vercel project; local file writes under `data/` become ephemeral `/tmp` on Vercel

## When adding features

- Prefer extending `lib/server/services/*` over bloating route handlers
- Keep secrets server-side; use relative `/api` paths (no `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL` on Vercel)
- Auth (in progress): root `proxy.ts` refreshes sessions; guest soft-limit + LoginModal — see authentication rule
